 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+
+## Discount codes
+
+An order takes one discount code at most, given with `orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`; a second code replaces the
+first. The discount comes off the order's items only, never its shipping, and the order's totals show it as
+`discountCents`; `totalCents` is items minus discount plus shipping.
+
+- `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items, rounded to the nearest cent, a half cent rounding up.
+- `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off the items, on an order whose items come to 30.00 € or more.
+
+An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused with an error saying why, and the order keeps the code it
+had. Whether an order ships free is decided on its items before any discount.
